{"author":{"id":"337a442880d7106d509ff84f2f7fef51acce8bce88b081d4f4c3f0298b7e7941"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1791688685,"nonce":"z7Ne/dPf06D3GybQ7QWyrD1JT5k=","message":"Decision: tracking.add_attachment (the drawer form) now copies a file outside the data dir into \u003cdata dir\u003e/attachments/ (sha256 checked, 0600) and stores the copy relative; a file inside the data dir is stored relative and not copied. Name clashes get -\u003csha256 first 12 hex\u003e before the suffix; an identical file already there is reused. Originals are never moved or deleted. Reason: spec 018 D18 (uploads copied in, ~/Documents not mounted) supersedes the old tracking docstring that said attachments are never copied.","files":null}]}